.SH NAME
rot \- Encrypts/decrypts using rot13
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
rot
.PP
(Accept standard input).
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
rot performs ROT13 encryption/decryption from the standard input into
the standard output. Note that it only handles ASCII properly.
.PP
For more information about ROT13, see:
.IP \(bu 4
<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ROT13>
.SH OPTIONS
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
All options are ignored.
